    ["尊敬的阁下：\n    当你看到这行文字时，家族契约已成。\n    在非凡的世界里，人性是易碎的灯。有人选择独自捧守，有人选择——与同行者互相照亮。\n    从今日起，你不再是孤身一人。\n    我们以家族为名，不以血缘相连，却以誓言为锁。我们向各自信仰的神灵起誓：在疯狂降临时彼此拉回，在黑暗侵袭时互为眼睛，在命运的深渊边缘互为锚点。\n    这是比魔药更深刻的改变，比晋升更漫长的修行。\n    记住：\n    从今往后，你的背后，永远有我们。"] = "Respected Excellency: \n    When you see this line of text, the Family contract is formed. \n    In the world of Beyonders, humanity is a fragile lamp. Some choose to hold it alone, while others choose—to illuminate each other with companions. \n    From today on, you are no longer alone. \n    We are named as a Family, not connected by blood, but locked by oaths. We swear to the gods we each believe in: to pull each other back when madness descends, to be each other's eyes when darkness invades, and to be each other's anchor at the edge of the abyss of fate. \n    This is a change more profound than a potion, a practice longer than advancement. \n    Remember: \n    From now on, you will always have us at your back.",
